Z||000000||ChadMan||05-02-2001||10:06 AM||||My mom and dad are selling their '78 Caprice Classic, 305 2-bbl, asking $750.<P>The good:<BR>Good solid body - garaged most of its life<BR>Nice interior<BR>Loaded with options<BR>Approx. 80K original miles<BR>Some newer parts including rebuilt carburetor and distributor<BR>My grandmother bought this car new<P>The bad:<BR>Paint fade on roof and hood<BR>Odd drivability problem...car idles and cruises fine, but exhibits severe hesitiation under acceleration.  This problem is worse when the engine is cold.<P>Email me or post questions here and I'll tell you anything you want to know about this classic American sedan.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif">||||reg||1
