Z||000002||stimpy||05-07-2001||02:53 PM||||Hmm. I kinda dig it. Got lots of ghetto sled appeal. Needs that 350 hp small block in there though. hehe<BR>How much of a hurry are you in to sell it?||||reg||1
Z||000003||ChadMan||05-08-2001||09:09 AM||||We're not in a huge hurry...it has been sitting in front of my parents' house for about a year, driven occasionally.  I just took it for a 20-minute drive last weekend.<P>Dad and I are stumped as to why it stumbles sometimes.  Compression checks out good and we put a rebuilt NAPA carb and rebuilt distributor on it, new plugs, new wires, and checked out all the vacuum lines under the hood and replaced several cracked ones.  Didn't seem to make much difference at all.  Our ignorance will be somebody's gain.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||1
